## Step order

Each required objective only accepts progress once the objective it is `after`
has completed — `ReportProgress` returns `false` and fires `OnObjectiveBlocked`
instead of advancing until then. By default this is filled in deterministically
from the list order above (objective *N* is after objective *N-1*), the same
sequence `ActiveObjective` already shows as "the current step"; the brief can
override individual objectives with a different — or no — prerequisite.
Optional objectives are never auto-chained, so they stay available any time
unless the brief explicitly gives one an `after` of its own.

